Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/c4pp4/g-unity7

Package: g-unity7-apt-pin
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: apt pin of the G Unity⁷ PPA
 Makes apt keep the packages of ppa:c4pp4/g-unity7 even if Ubuntu has a newer
 version of them, until their G Unity⁷ version is released in the PPA. Without
 it, a newer Ubuntu version would replace a G Unity⁷ package and its changes.
 .
 Packages that are not in the PPA are not affected.
 .
 Firefox and Thunderbird of the PPA are kept only after g-unity7-cleanup
 installed them instead of the snaps of Ubuntu.
